@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC19 Xem tour va thu tu lo trinh

actor "Khach tham quan" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebPublicUI - ToursPage, TourDetailPage va TourRoutePage" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nPublicToursController + TourService + PublicPoiService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nTourRepository + TourTranslationRepository + TourPoiRepository + PoiRepository + MediaRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo danh sach hoac chi tiet tour
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau tour theo ngon ngu
Business -> DataAccess: Doc tour active va quan he diem dung
DataAccess -> Database: Doc Tour, TourTranslation va TourPoi
Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu tour
DataAccess --> Business: Tra tour ung vien
Business -> DataAccess: Doc POI va anh Approved cua diem dung
DataAccess -> Database: Doc Poi, PoiTranslation va MediaFile
Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu diem dung
DataAccess --> Business: Tra POI
Business -> Business: Loc POI cong khai va sap xep OrderIndex
alt Tour ton tai va active
  Business --> UI: Tra tour va cac diem dung
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi chi tiet va thu tu lo trinh
else Tour khong ton tai, inactive hoac da xoa
  Business --> UI: Tra loi khong tim thay
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi thong bao
end
opt Khach chon nghe audio
  UI --> Actor: Chuyen sang luong UC23 neu co access pass
end
@enduml
